# An edge is a claim the oracle has to meet. The heat-engine oracle escapes lone surrogates
# (json/sorted-utf16, its spec's choice). Bound to json/rfc8785 instead, which refuses them, the
# pack items with lone surrogates fail against the oracle (T006): the spec and its own model
# disagree, and `tilth check` says where.
tilth 0.1

spec heat-engine-rfc8785 0.1

oracle node ../heat-engine/oracle-driver.mjs

op canonical
  input value any
  request {}

edge json/rfc8785 via canonical value
